a isla virtual y completa cinco retos matem\u00e1ticos utilizando los controladores de Meta Quest. Cada respuesta permite avanzar en la aventura, obtener monedas y recibir retroalimentaci\u00f3n visual y sonora.\n\nAl completar los desaf\u00edos, descubre el resultado de tu aventura y decide si quieres volver a jugar o salir de la experiencia.\n\nLa interacci\u00f3n est\u00e1 dise\u00f1ada espec\u00edficamente para realidad virtual mediante controles XR y apuntado por rayos, ofreciendo una experiencia sencilla, accesible y enfocada en el aprendizaje mediante la pr\u00e1ctica.", "short_description": "Explora una isla en realidad virtual y supera divertidos retos matem\u00e1ticos mientras aprendes, obtienes monedas y avanzas hasta completar la aventura."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.academusdigital.com/politica-de-privacidad-apps/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AcademusDigital", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.academusdigital.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es_MX"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1323316050875240"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "937610792744888"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "937610792744888"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1789765320, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "937610792744888"}]}, "li